        <dictScrap type="liebermann"><lbl type="language">L</lbl> <hi rend="bold">stabilita(s)</hi> <hi rend="italic">Netzvorrichtung zum Fangen des Rotwildes;</hi> -tatem (<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Variante"><abbr>Var.</abbr></ref></hi> ~litam) observare <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 2 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref>, sæte haldan <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ubersetzend"><abbr>übsnd</abbr></ref>;</hi> si quis ad - (<hi rend="italic">königlicher Jagd, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Variante"><abbr>Var.</abbr></ref></hi> ~tam) non venit <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 17,1 [<hi rend="italic">Heinrich I. beschenkt um</hi> 1115 <hi rend="italic">Salisbury <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:mit"><abbr>mit</abbr></ref> Jagdzehnt, behält sich <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aber"><abbr>aber</abbr></ref> davon vor:</hi> decimam illius venationis quae capta erit cum stabilia; Registr. Saresber. <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sanctus"><abbr>S.</abbr></ref> Osmundi <ref type="lawCode" target="law:I">I</ref> 201]</dictScrap>
